# Follow the contribution guide

Any development in this repository must follow `CONTRIBUTING.md`:

- architecture and testing layout
- `todo.md` as the feature checklist
- pytest mandatory vs optional
- mandatory tests after every new feature
- version bumps only in `VERSION` (feature = minor, fix = patch, release = major)
